1
00:00:02,300 --> 00:00:04,650
The mover called with good news.

2
00:00:05,400 --> 00:00:07,725
Them: We have a truck two days early.

3
00:00:07,725 --> 00:00:10,725
Them: We can come Monday instead of Wednesday.

4
00:00:11,575 --> 00:00:12,712
Sounds helpful.

5
00:00:12,712 --> 00:00:14,000
Here's the catch.

6
00:00:14,750 --> 00:00:17,712
If you're not packed, their crew packs what's left.

7
00:00:17,712 --> 00:00:19,280
By the hour, or by the box.

8
00:00:19,280 --> 00:00:22,300
Work you'd have done yourself, on your own schedule.

9
00:00:23,050 --> 00:00:25,388
You don't have to take the earlier truck.

10
00:00:25,388 --> 00:00:28,125
Keep the date you booked, and get it in writing.

11
00:00:29,580 --> 00:00:30,549
Keep your date.

12
00:00:30,549 --> 00:00:31,971
Packed Rabbit dot com.

13
00:00:31,971 --> 00:00:35,008
A moving app made by a consumer, for consumers.

14
00:00:35,008 --> 00:00:39,855
If this helped, like it, share it with someone who's moving, and subscribe.

